# Three players: Doubling Season makes Mardu Siegebreaker's creation twice that many of those tokens (CR 614.1a). Each further
# copy is made for an opponent by the same "for each opponent ... attacking that opponent", so it attacks that opponent too, with
# no choice asked (CR 508.4): two Ornithopter copies attack Bot2 and two attack Bot3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Doubling Season
Ornithopter
Mardu Siegebreaker
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Bot3 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
